# Baseline — Subject 02, Task 0 (must-fail-first evidence)
#
# Captured against the pre-fix tree (crates/core/src/db/retention.rs as
# shipped, before any Subject 02 Build step). No live D1/Wrangler
# environment is available here, so this reproduces the exact SQL text
# `archive_old_records` and `run_cleanup` execute, against local SQLite
